# PHP page deployment guide

Files created:
- index.php
- styles.css
- script.js

## What it includes
- PHP form handling
- Black background and yellow text
- Yellow input styling
- Dark mode and light mode toggle
- Small JavaScript animation effect

## Upload to a free PHP host
Use a host that supports PHP, such as:
- InfinityFree
- 000webhost
- FreeHostia

### Upload steps
1. Create an account on a free PHP host.
2. Create a new website or project.
3. Upload these files to the public web folder:
   - index.php
   - styles.css
   - script.js
4. Open your website URL.

> Note: PHP pages need a real PHP server. GitHub Pages will not run PHP.
